        "date": "2026-11-16T21:37:46Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): debug info logs the frame rate on a change and docks as a tab\n\nThe frame-rate rule reads the frame stamps the shell already takes: one\nline for a new level, at most one summary (min, max, mean) each 10 s while\nit keeps moving, nothing while idle. The gpu slow-frame line uses the same\n10 s limit. The Debug info panel is a dock tab (dock, tab, float, close).\n\nFixes #2262\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
