      "message": "fix(ui): Debug info door under the Operations label, wasm module gates, dock layout test\n\nThe \"N Operations\" label sat after the status line in a left-to-right\nlayout and ran onto the door; it is now placed before the line. The\nframe_rate module builds on wasm32 (state.rs holds it); frame_watch is\ngated off wasm again as on main. layout_window_debug_info checks the\ndock tab. Refs #2262\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
